{'symbol': 'EQIX', 'date': '2023-02-16 04:01:00', 'title': 'EQUINIX TO BUILD NEW DATA CENTER IN BARCELONA--A GROWING CONNECTIVITY HUB OF THE MEDITERRANEAN', 'text': "REDWOOD CITY, CALIF. , FEB. 16, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AS BARCELONA BECOMES AN INCREASINGLY STRATEGIC HUB FOR THE TERRESTRIAL AND SUBSEA CABLE NETWORKS CONNECTING OUR DIGITAL LIVES, EQUINIX, INC.\xa0(NASDAQ: EQIX), THE WORLD'S DIGITAL INFRASTRUCTURE COMPANY™, IS BUILDING ITS SECOND DATA CENTER IN THE METRO."}